  "description": "Heo Yun-Ah, the kind and capable class president of Class 1-2, is asked by her homeroom teacher to look after the new transfer student, Lee Do. But the two are worlds apart. Will Heo Yun-Ah, the kind yet hypocritical class president, and Lee Do, the aloof yet honest Korean-American transfer student, be able to understand each other?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
